      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726020/extras/2405bba2b29ed23a65eac352126612ce.avif?t=1763216810\" width=610 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most secure prison facility in the country<br>is under attack ... <br>The city mayor called personally and asked you to take care of this problem. <br>You are <strong>Jake</strong>, ex-military and a member of <strong>Team</strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726020/extras/7ec0ece9aa8cfe318d330b1e5895a6fc.webp?t=1763216810\" width=109 height=20 /></span>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission Ammunition</strong> is a modern action game with a lot of justified pixel violence and the clever platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726020/extras/be90b541ae2c6e4c03ee572d39cf455c.webp?t=1763216810\" width=219 height=31 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726020/extras/0cde5f5be6cf79f2a49015472354cd70.webp?t=1763216810\" width=24 height=12 /></span> Over 30 levels of action<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726020/extras/67e2e62385a71595ece084d0ef3f04c1.webp?t=1763216810\" width=24 height=12 /></span> Ultra-sharp and detailed pixel art <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726020/extras/86d058282b0bc01e161909d6bc207bad.webp?t=1763216810\" width=24 height=12 /></span> Super-tough boss fights <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726020/extras/c3b269cc695f0268453ef3fb314e74fb.webp?t=1763216810\" width=24 height=12 /></span> Very reasonable number of powerful guns <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726020/extras/98332b1c079fd330db6e4fabbd9bf916.webp?t=1763216810\" width=24 height=12 /></span> Great accompanying music <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726020/extras/5e54031757679fe3ec711182bf9ccf29.webp?t=1763216810\" width=24 height=12 /></span> Top secret locations <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726020/extras/d55638f91187ad14465a389465ea4913.webp?t=1763216810\" width=24 height=12 /></span> Spectacular explosions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726020/extras/506e4131d2331d8bbb9df3aebf898f45.webp?t=1763216810\" width=24 height=12 /></span> Pure old-school awesomeness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726020/extras/2405bba2b29ed23a65eac352126612ce.avif?t=1763216810\" width=610 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most secure prison facility in the country<br>is under attack ... <br>The city mayor called personally and asked you to take care of this problem. <br>You are <strong>Jake</strong>, ex-military and a member of <strong>Team</strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726020/extras/7ec0ece9aa8cfe318d330b1e5895a6fc.webp?t=1763216810\" width=109 height=20 /></span>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission Ammunition</strong> is a modern action game with a lot of justified pixel violence and the clever platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726020/extras/be90b541ae2c6e4c03ee572d39cf455c.webp?t=1763216810\" width=219 height=31 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726020/extras/0cde5f5be6cf79f2a49015472354cd70.webp?t=1763216810\" width=24 height=12 /></span> Over 30 levels of action<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726020/extras/67e2e62385a71595ece084d0ef3f04c1.webp?t=1763216810\" width=24 height=12 /></span> Ultra-sharp and detailed pixel art <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app